> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what you're saying is that this secret cult of vampires might have their base in the land of the dead where they might, for example, safely store powerful Kindred laying in Torpor away from their enemies (such as Strix)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's a highly original concept.<br /> <br /> I was actually thinking more of just using the shallow Underworld to simply move around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T11:46:08-07:00","id":1121432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1120287-de2-arthurian-discussion?p=1121426#post1121426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So what you're saying is that this secret cult of vampires might have their base in the land of the dead where they might, for example, safely store powerful Kindred laying in Torpor away from their enemies (such as Strix)?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>The once and future king sleeps in Avalon...</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the 